<description>&lt;p&gt;Federal forces continue advancing in Tigray while militia attacks near the Kenya border have killed civilians and displaced thousands, with 10,000 Kenyans forced to move as refugees exceed 50,000. Ethiopian drones are operating over Sudan and RSF drones are launching from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. Drone and artillery strikes have occurred between Ethiopia and Eritrea near Badme, and Eritrea is accused of directing a Tigray rebel offensive with Egyptian support. A US government contractor pleaded guilty to spying for Ethiopia. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPNDNLYVFjMzVtckJFOVJ6b2hOaG9VMzFhM3Z0bzdHMkNjYVVwdk1WYVBWc3RUMXFLTmJKNUN2NTJiQmdWYlhpSC1NZmQ0VjJRNElLcTFSTGoyYVN6NE90NHU2Wng0c0hFMk1Qek9FU1E1SDg1dzNnMWJ0RGxTcVBYOExvc3BuNkw2U0paVlZMblFMWF9GTVR2VnBsRlQtaDVjN1otTVcwWU5NMGZYc3ZGUF9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBvR0ZFTTdYWHlfOVJZeWMxUnZDZ3NMZ2tnb1BYeFdSR3FzZ0FsQWZKYmNFYjdQUkhSVE5nMFFpS2RpQXhNRkN6ZnNlZlFPcnJQRi1jZ2hOb2hBVlVVN1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/acc_10nov26_550_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTFBVUFA3X0VvcjhNN093NjV1cGlFc0pBRDZMSzVEazBoSnZfOUxqWjFWWVhNeXI4OWptOWVTMTVvNkgwYXk4cFN2YlhDSnEtUWxkTEd5cXF3YkVKc2paLUV4SzJUT2YwYmZmMXY4dTV3WFRhdVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inshorts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTFBOWTE1alRLV2l